@title Label directions for the whole range
@subtitle Four visual directions, each applied to all 12 beers, with your three hard constraints checked
@width wide

Four directions that differ in mood, not just in colour: heritage, loud, calm and handmade. Each one is applied to every beer below, so you can read across and pick one or steal pieces. Everything here is a written spec (colours, type, layout, ABV treatment, per-beer treatment). Hex values and sizes are my proposals to be proofed, because your current navy and brass codes were not supplied.

kpi SKUs | 12 | 11 selling, 1 launching Dec 1
kpi Q3 revenue | $603,300 | 11 selling SKUs
kpi Top three SKUs | 62% of revenue | Dock Street, Harbour Lights, Widow's Peak
kpi ABV range | 0.5% to 10.4% | on one shelf

